# -L tells curl to follow HTTP redirects. The parser flips
# HttpRequest.follow_redirects to true and pushes a
# SignalKind::FollowRedirects so the matcher's no_redirects
# predicate (default-deny) refuses to auto-allow rules that
# don't explicitly opt into redirect-following trust.
# ThreatModel T10.
-L
https://example.test/redir
